{"event_id": "evt-f591bfaf2de8", "parent_event_id": null, "payload": {"alignment_reason": "clear_enough", "alignment_state": "idle", "clarification_count": 0, "forge_stage": "entry", "hook_kind": "scenario", "learning_unit_id": "lu-0f86e922", "objective_status": "working", "orientation_digest": "f4d9af54de9b3515", "phase": "absorbing", "prompt_text": "想象一下，你要在图书馆找一本书，如果书架上的书没有按照任何顺序排列，你会怎么快速找到它呢？你觉得索引就像是给这些书排序的规则吗？", "regenerated": false, "source": "llm", "source_seed_ref": "objective:索引这东西我总是迷糊。", "temperature_state": "steady"}, "seq": 4, "session_id": "sess-ac60fca0", "ts": "2026-05-31T08:32:11.208754Z", "type": "learning_unit.orientation_generated", "visibility": "agent"}
